WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Hey there it's me, Conan.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.810
I wanna talk about something important.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.530
Recently, we invited our fans

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.130
to recreate an episode of our show.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.260
We did this because we thought
it would be challenging,

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.700
we thought it would be
fun, and, most important,

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.010
we thought it would be a way for people

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.920
to kill just a few hours
during the pandemic.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.980
We received just hundreds

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.060
and hundreds of incredibly
creative entries

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.820
and we stitched them together
to make one amazing program,

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.733
DIY Conan.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.850
We're very proud of our fans.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.363
We're very proud of this show.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.947
Enjoy.

00:00:36.947 --> 00:00:38.347
♪ Do, do, do, do, do ♪

00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:40.065
♪ Do, do, do, do ♪

00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:41.445
♪ Do, do, do, do, do ♪

00:00:41.445 --> 00:00:43.087
♪ Do, do, do, do ♪

00:00:43.087 --> 00:00:48.087
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.280
[Andy] Coming to you from all our fans,

00:00:52.221 --> 00:00:53.471
it's DIY Conan.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.020
I'm Andy Richter.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.990
Tonight, Kumail Naniani

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:03.040
and associate producer, Jordan Schlansky.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.430
Now, here he is, Conan O'Brien.

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:14.102
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:28.686
We can do it.

00:01:28.686 --> 00:01:30.466
We can do it.

00:01:30.466 --> 00:01:33.466
(audience cheering)

00:01:34.765 --> 00:01:35.598
Thank you.

00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:37.762
Hey, thank you.

00:01:39.739 --> 00:01:42.406
Thank you. Please, for God sake.

